  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[uglify-js](https://www.npmjs.com/package/uglify-js) just published its new version 2.7.5.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Failing tests :rotating_light:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      uglify-js\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      2.7.5\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      devDependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\nThis version is **covered** by your **current version range** and after updating it in your project **the build went from success to failure**.\n\nAs uglify-js is “only” a devDependency of this project it **might not break production or downstream projects**, but “only” your build or test tools – **preventing new deploys or publishes**.\n\nI recommend you give this issue a high priority. I’m sure you can resolve this :muscle:\n\n\nOf course this could just be a false positive, caused by a flaky test suite, or third parties that are currently broken or unavailable, but that would be another problem I’d recommend working on.\n\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\nThe new version differs by 7 commits .\n\n- [`f637248`](https://github.com/mishoo/UglifyJS2/commit/f6372483a0c555a3aaf900ffa1a9ccc6585b59f9) <code>v2.7.5</code>\n- [`98f3306`](https://github.com/mishoo/UglifyJS2/commit/98f330658f5cd0dfb3004815d05f123f4110c2e0) <code>Generate source map data from normalized files</code>\n- [`a7b3b0d`](https://github.com/mishoo/UglifyJS2/commit/a7b3b0d3a55e2c48b63102dd111f27f8b9717788) <code>docs: add doc for option.outFileName</code>\n- [`0a35acb`](https://github.com/mishoo/UglifyJS2/commit/0a35acbbe7e663c643c5b227e455816278e08b89) <code>feat: add option.outFileName for JS API, if absense, sourceMap.file field will deduced</code>\n- [`2a9989d`](https://github.com/mishoo/UglifyJS2/commit/2a9989dd18c01081c486fe9089e3bb64079c773b) <code>Add --mangle-props-debug and fix --mangle-props=unquoted collision</code>\n- [`79b98a9`](https://github.com/mishoo/UglifyJS2/commit/79b98a9fe87f950607c601a45a3566a46c32f425) <code>Do not overwrite options.comments + cleanup</code>\n- [`057de57`](https://github.com/mishoo/UglifyJS2/commit/057de570e69b300ca472719cb234a32e593d34ec) <code>Pass mangle options to figure_out_scope before mangling in tests</code>\n\nSee the [full diff](https://github.com/mishoo/UglifyJS2/compare/557b3e412fb44906e0a41dc2c209e5712bd67974...f6372483a0c555a3aaf900ffa1a9ccc6585b59f9).\n\n---\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>",
